  << /ActualText (React Native engineer with 5 years shipping production mobile apps\054 including 3\053 years at a Fintech\057Crypto platform handling regulated banking infrastructure\054 where I built the app\047s compliance system and navigation architecture\056 Experience designing apps from scratch\054 writing native iOS modules\054 and working on legacy\055to\055modern migrations across multiple companies\056 Background also spans web \050React\054 Vue\054 Angular\051 and Backend \050Django\054 Python\051 from university and personal projects\056)
