1450 0 obj
  << /ActualText (experience\nNash\056io \174 Frontend Developer\nNon\055custodial cryptocurrency exchange and platform offering trading\054 payment services\054 and digital asset management\056\nMarch 2023 \055 June 2026 \0503 years 4 months\051\nDesigned and built the compliance system architecture \023 a global async singleton to eliminate race conditions\054 plus a feature\055availability interface \023 working directly with backend to ship it\nMigrated the app off a legacy custom navigation system \050untyped\054 re\055render\055heavy modal\057stack wrappers\051 to a typed React Navigation architecture \050Stack\057Modal\057Bottom Tab\051\nRemoved legacy MobX stores in favor of Redux \053 redux\055persist as part of an ongoing architecture modernization effort\nRefactored technical debt as part of daily work \023 e\056g\056\054 rewrote the payment modal rather than patching it while fixing a bug in it\nBuilt a native iOS encryption module \050CryptoModule\051 for debit card data from scratch\054 researching key parsing and encryption\057decryption with no prior cryptography experience\nDesigned features in code alongside product \050e\056g\056\054 Contacts\054 Earn\051 when the team had no dedicated designer \023 prototyping directly in React Native and iterating with the team over screenshots\nConsolidated scattered deep\055link handling across the app into a single LinkAgent service \023 improving maintainability and reliability of link\057state restoration\nBuilt the ModulR\057IBAN banking integration \050account funding\054 transfers\054 card issuance\051 \023 worked against incomplete\057mid\055transition designs\054 improvising UX where specs were missing\054 and integrated the full GraphQL surface with BE\nWrote and maintained a local Maestro e2e suite \050refactored shared helpers\057config across the full suite covering KYC\054 compliance\054 IBAN\054 NFR trading\054 Earn\054 etc\056\051\nImplemented GraphQL cache normalization with local persistence so list data renders instantly before server hydration \023 resolved sync issues between the local cache and virtualized list rendering\nBuilt UI and API integration for Contacts\054 Round\055up purchases\054 Automations\054 Earn\054 Price Alerts and other in\055app features\nWorked in a small frontend team with daily code review in both directions\054 and with backend on GraphQL schema design across most features above\nContacts V2\072 Friends\054 Chats and seamless transactions inside chat windows\056\nNash Exchange \046 Nash Widget Monorepo Support \024 Web Platform \050same company\054 separate web codebase from the mobile app\051\nDiagnosed and fixed precision\055related display bugs in withdrawals and portfolio balances\nBuilt compliance\055adjacent flows for the fiat on\057off\055ramp\072 source\055of\055funds and occupation confirmation\054 sell quote flow\nMiCA\055related request improvements\n\nStartup Porttie \174 React Native Developer\nHotel booking app MVP\056\nDecember 2022 \055 March 2023 \0504 months\051\nBootstrapped the app from scratch \023 stack selection\054 project structure\054 navigation\054 and state management patterns\nChose React Native \050old architecture\051 with MobX over Redux\054 prioritizing shipping speed for a small\054 fast\055moving MVP feature set\nBuilt the full data layer from scratch \023 network providers\054 DTO\055to\055domain model adapters\054 and MobX stores using dependency injection \050tsyringe\051 with reactive state syncing\nImplemented map\055based hotel search with dynamic radius calculation and clustering \050supercluster\054 geo\055viewport bounding box\051 \023 including a discriminated\055union search flow supporting both region search and direct single\055hotel lookup\057deep\055linking\nIntegrated and heavily customized react\055native\055calendars for date\055range\057availability selection\054 coordinating with backend on the data contract for availability\nDesigned empty\055state handling across the app \050filtered list \042not found\042 states\054 dedicated not\055found screen wired into navigation\051\nReviewed designs with the team in Figma before implementation and contributed UX changes\nSet up react\055native\055appmetrica\055yandex analytics and Sentry crash reporting\n\nStartup Take A Place \174 React Native Developer\nCoworking\055space booking app\056\nMay 2022 \055 June 2023 \0501 year 2 months\051\nBuilt features across a multi\055city coworking marketplace\072 multi\055city rollout \050added Saint Petersburg \023 city model\054 adapter\054 localization\051\054 a points\057loyalty payment system\054 and a referral program\nRefactored the app\047s authorization flow\nMigrated lists to FlashList for performance\nBuilt subscriptions UI integrated with a card\055based web view payment flow\nImplemented gesture\055driven UI and animations using Reanimated and Gesture Handler \023 including a custom animated wheel picker \050no library\051\054 animated bottom drawers\054 skeleton loaders\054 and review\055rating animations\056\nBuilt a multi\055criteria coworking filter system \050MobX computed chains for room type\054 price range\054 tags\054 and sorting\051 and map filters\nFixed cross\055platform bugs \050Android map rendering\054 region restoration from local storage\054 working\055hours modal\051\nShipped Reviews\054 Booking\054 Pages\054 Favorites\054 promo codes\054 and other user\055facing features\nLocalized the app with i18n \050RU\057EN\051\nHelped with Firebase Cloud Messaging \050push notifications\051\054 deeplinking\054 and analytics\nWorked with Gatsby based landing website and GraphQL\n\npoVoenke \174 React Native Developer\niOS\057Android mobile application for real\055estate purchase\056\nMarch 2021 \055 March 2023 \0502 years 1 month\051\nPrimary engineer on the Banks\057Documents module for over a year \023 built bank onboarding\054 document upload\057management\054 and file handling flows\073 worked on full redesigns of the Documents \050Jan\023Feb 2022\051 and Banks \050Apr\023Jul 2022\051 areas\nRefactored a legacy codebase into a maintainable component\057store structure following React patterns\nBuilt local\055first data layer with Realm \023 repository pattern with a generic AbstractArrayRepo\054 stale\055while\055revalidate loading \050serve from local DB\054 then refresh from server\051 across Buildings\054 Banks\054 Contacts\054 and Calculator modules\nReduced crash rate by triaging and fixing native crashes and long\055tail bugs surfaced through Sentry\nMentored a junior developer \023 code review\054 written feedback\054 and pairing calls\nRebuilt UI for a full app redesign \050new Figma design system\051 across Buildings\054 Calculator\054 and other modules\054 closing out with a Buildings redesign\n\nUniversity Project Maff Metaverse \174 Frontend Lead Developer\nMetaverse development company\056\nNov 2021 \055 Dec 2021 \0501 month\051\nSet up team workflow and managed work in Trello\056\nDesigned game concept and project architecture\056\nContributed to park integration in Decentraland\056\n\nUniversity Project Fizruk \174 Frontend Lead Developer\nManagement system for the Department of Physical Education at Moscow Polytech University\056\nJan 2020 \055 Dec 2022 \0502 years 11 months\051\nLed the frontend team\056\nBuilt student\055facing personal account with viewing features\056\nBuilt teacher\055facing personal account for managing students\056\nCoached junior developers\056\nStack\072 React\054 TypeScript\054 MobX\054 Styled Components\056\n\neducation\nMoscow Polytech \024 BSc\054 Web Technologies\n2019 \055 2023\054 Moscow\nFundamentals of Computer Science\054 UX\054 Business \046 Marketing\054 Tech Law\056\nCompleted Cisco Networking Academy\056\nMachine learning basics\056\nBuilt numerous small and medium projects using React\054 Vue\054 Angular\054 Kotlin\054 Python\054 Django\054 Docker\054 SQL\054 and PostgreSQL\056)
